<%#
# Grafana page body

The body of the Monitoring and Logs pages: a line of advice and the Grafana
dashboard embedded in a block (kiosk mode).

## Local variables:

- `hint`: the line of advice above the dashboard.
- `embed_url`: the address of the dashboard (kiosk mode).
- `frame_title`: the accessible name of the frame.
%>
<section class="main-content__body">
  <div class="admin-notice mb-4"><%= hint %></div>
  <div class="admin-card overflow-hidden">
    <iframe
      src="<%= embed_url %>"
      title="<%= frame_title %>"
      class="min-h-[85vh] w-full bg-n-solid-2"
      loading="lazy"
      referrerpolicy="same-origin"
    ></iframe>
  </div>
</section>
